      "Anchor": "compliance-snapshot-overview",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This documentation summarizes all Compliance APIs you will need to initially call to gather information on authenticated members (including their profile, current activities and more) for the purpose of your regulatory compliance.",
